lumns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:28px}\\n  footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin:0 0 12px}\\n  footer ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\\n  footer li{margin-bottom:8px}\\n  .copy{border-top:1px solid #4a443f;margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;text-align:center;color:#a9a29a}\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"ship-banner HDLmClassDA6EC334\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-label=\\\"Shipping offer\\\">\\n  <span class=\\\"ship-item\\\"><strong>FREE SHIPPING</strong> on orders over $99</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"ship-sep\\\">|</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"ship-item\\\">Orders ship same business day if placed by 2pm ET</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"ship-sep\\\">|</span>\\n  <span class=\\\"ship-item\\\"><a href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Now &rsaquo;</a></span>\\n</div>\\n\\n<header class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap hdr\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"logo\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">Yoga<span>Direct</span></a>\\n    <form class=\\\"searchbox\\\" action=\\\"/search\\\" method=\\\"get\\\" role=\\\"search\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"search\\\" name=\\\"q\\\" placeholder=\\\"Search yoga mats, blocks, straps, bolsters...\\\" aria-label=\\\"Search products\\\">\\n      <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Search</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <div class=\\\"hdr-actions\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/account\\\">Sign In</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cart\\\" href=\\\"/cart\\\">Cart (0)</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<nav class=\\\"main\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <ul>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Straps</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/blankets\\\">Blankets</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/meditation\\\">Meditation</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n      <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n    </ul>\\n  </div>\\n</nav>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h1>Yoga mats &amp; props direct from the source</h1>\\n    <p>Supplying the yoga community since 1999. Studio-quality gear for your practice, your studio, and your next event &mdash; at prices you will love.</p>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Best Sellers</a>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn btn-alt\\\" href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio &amp; Bulk Pricing</a>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Featured Products</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>Deluxe 1/4\\\" Yoga Mat</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$21.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/product/deluxe-yoga-mat\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>Foam Yoga Block</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/product/foam-yoga-block\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>8&#39; Cotton Yoga Strap</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$6.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/product/cotton-yoga-strap\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div>\\n        <h3>Rectangular Yoga Bolster</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/product/yoga-bolster\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer class=\\\"site\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fcols\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Yoga Blocks</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps\\\">Yoga Straps</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/studio-packs\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Customer Service</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Information</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Company</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About YogaDirect</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale Program</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/privacy\\\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/terms\\\">Terms of Use</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Stay Connected</h4>\\n        <p>Join our list for new arrivals and exclusive offers.</p>\\n        <form action=\\\"/newsletter\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email address\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px;width:100%;max-width:240px;border:0;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:10px\\\">\\n          <br>\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\" style=\\\"background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:0;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer\\\">Sign Up</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"copy\\\">&copy; 1999&ndash;2024 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</div>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added free shipping banner\",\"Why\":\"Free shipping offers boost conversions and order value.\",\"Hash\":\"HDLmClassDA6EC334\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm reconstructing the HTML page with the fetched content and adding a free shipping banner at the top as the only modification. I'll compute the DJB2 hash and include the banner to communicate the shipping threshold upfront, which should help reduce cart abandonment.\n\nComputing DJB2 hash... Continuing the hash computation through the remaining characters, applying the DJB2 algorithm with modulo 2^32 arithmetic at each step to keep the values within 32-bit bounds. Continuing through characters 'h', 'i', 'p', 'p', 'i' with their ASCII values, performing the rolling hash calculations and modulo operations to track the remainder at each step. Continuing the hash computation through characters 23-26, tracking the modular arithmetic as each character gets processed and the running value gets adjusted against the power-of-two boundaries. Continuing through the hash computation for the remaining characters in \"Free shipping\" — working through the modular arithmetic for 'i', 'p', 'p', 'i', 'n' and tracking the differences against powers of 2^32. Continuing the hash computation through characters 47-49, tracking the modular arithmetic and overflow adjustments as I process each character's ASCII value. Continuing the hash calculations through characters 53-55, tracking the modular arithmetic operations as I work through the string. Continuing through the hash computation for th