ck\\\">High Density Foam Yoga Block</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bulk-note HDLmClassC4EE31D5\\\">Buying 10+? See wholesale price</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-blocks/foam-block\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"badge\\\">Studio Pick</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\">Bolster</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734; (139)</div>\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/bolsters/round-bolster\\\">Round Cotton Yoga Bolster</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bulk-note HDLmClassC4EE31D5\\\">Buying 10+? See wholesale price</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\" href=\\\"/bolsters/round-bolster\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"ph\\\">Strap</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733; (204)</div>\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/yoga-straps/d-ring-strap\\\">8ft Cotton D-Ring Yoga Strap</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bulk-note HDLmClassC4EE31D5\\\">Buying 10+? See wholesale price</div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-straps/d-ring-strap\\\">Add to Cart</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"wholesale HDLmClass621B4E31\\\" id=\\\"wholesale\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h2>Wholesale &amp; bulk pricing for studios, gyms, schools and events</h2>\\n      <p>We manufacture and source our own goods, so you buy direct &mdash; no middleman markup. Thousands of studios, universities, hotels and corporate wellness programs order from YogaDirect every year.</p>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Tiered volume discounts &mdash; the more you order, the more you save</li>\\n        <li>Dedicated acc