 <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Foam Yoga Block</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pname\\\">Recycled Foam Yoga Block</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"rating HDLmClass74365415\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</span> 4.8 <a href=\\\"#reviews\\\">(1,704 reviews)</a></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"addbtn\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Cotton Yoga Strap</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pname\\\">8ft Cotton Yoga Strap</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$6.95</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"rating HDLmClass74365415\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★☆</span> 4.7 <a href=\\\"#reviews\\\">(986 reviews)</a></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"addbtn\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Supportive Bolster</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"pname\\\">Rectangular Yoga Bolster</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.95</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"rating HDLmClass74365415\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</span> 4.9 <a href=\\\"#reviews\\\">(1,142 reviews)</a></div>\\n      <button class=\\\"addbtn\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"reviews HDLmClassb60961ba\\\" id=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <h2 class=\\\"section\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"sub\\\">12,400+ verified reviews from studios, teachers, and home practitioners</p>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"review-summary\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"score\\\">4.8</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">12,417 verified reviews</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"bars\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"barrow\\\">5★ <span class=\\\"bar\\\"><i style=\\\"width:84%\\\"></i></span> 84%</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"barrow\\\">4★ <span class=\\\"bar\\\"><i style=\\\"width:11%\\\"></i></span> 11%</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"barrow\\\">3★ <span class=\\\"bar\\\"><i style=\\\"width:3%\\\"></i></span> 3%</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"barrow\\\">2★ <span class=\\\"bar\\\"><i style=\\\"width:1%\\\"></i></span> 1%</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"barrow\\\">1★ <span class=\\\"bar\\\"><i style=\\\"width:1%\\\"></i></span> 1%</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"max-width:260px\\\">\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:0 0 12px\\\"><strong>97%</strong> of reviewers would buy from YogaDirect again.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/mats\\\">Shop Top-Rated Gear</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"rgrid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"rcard\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n        <h4>Outfitted my whole studio</h4>\\n        <p>We ordered 30 mats, blocks, and straps for our studio. Quality is excellent for the price and everything arrived in three days.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">Marisa T. — Studio Owner <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"rcard\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n        <h4>Great grip, no slipping</h4>\\n        <p>I practice hot yoga four times a week and this mat still holds up. Much better than mats I've paid twice as much for.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">Devin R. — Home Practitioner <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"rcard\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★☆</div>\\n        <h4>Reliable for events</h4>\\n        <p>We use YogaDirect for our annual community event every year. Easy bulk ordering and the team answers questions quickly.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">Priya S. — Event Organizer <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <p class=\\\"sub\\\" style=\\\"margin:26px 0 0\\\"><a href=\\\"/reviews\\\"><strong>Read all 12,417 reviews →</strong></a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wrap about\\\">\\n  <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  <p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/mats\\\">Start Shopping</a></p>\\n</div>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap fgrid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h5>Shop</h5>\\n      <ul><li><a href=\\\"/mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/props\\\">Props</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/studio\\\">Studio Packs</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li></ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h5>Help</h5>\\n      <ul><li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li></ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h5>Company</h5>\\n      <ul><li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About Us</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/reviews\\\">Customer Reviews</a></li></ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"HDLmClassb60961ba\\\">\\n      <h5>Rated 4.8 / 5</h5>\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Based on 12,417 verified customer reviews.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" style=\\\"